  'Warm air, Moisture and Updraft can form thunderstorms over land or sea. Their gusts add city damage. Dry air, Cold air and Downdraft suppress them.': '暖空气、水汽和上升气流汇聚，可在陆地或海上形成雷暴，其阵风会加重城市受灾。干燥空气、冷空气和下沉气流可抑制雷暴。',

