  'Ranking': '排行榜', 'Ranking metric': '排名依据', 'No ranked storms yet.': '暂无上榜风暴。',
  'Deaths (estimated)': '死亡人数（估计）', 'Survival time': '存续时间', 'Grade': '等级', 'Merged': '已并入',
  'Clear ranking': '清除排行榜', 'Clear the saved ranking on this device?': '要清除此设备上保存的排行榜吗？',
  'Ended storms from every world on this device. Active storms are listed until they end.': '此设备上所有世界中已结束的风暴。活跃风暴会在结束前一直列出。',
  'Development stages': '发展阶段变化', 'Status': '状态', 'Active': '活跃',
  'Extratropical transition': '变性为温带气旋', 'No ended storms yet.': '暂无已结束的风暴。',
  'Return the whole climate to normal: sliders, scenario and El Niño / La Niña': '让整个气候恢复正常：滑块、情景和厄尔尼诺 / 拉尼娜',
  'The climate cannot be reset while a replay plays.': '回放播放期间无法重置气候。',
  'The climate is already normal.': '气候已经是正常状态。',
  'Shortcuts work from anywhere on the page, except while you type in a field or a dialog is open; with a button or tab focused, Space and Enter press it instead of playing or pausing.': '快捷键在页面任何位置都有效，但在输入框中打字或对话框打开时除外；焦点在按钮或标签页上时，空格键和回车键会按下该控件，而不是播放或暂停。',
  'Movement speed measures travel, not wind. Gale radius estimates the area with winds of at least 17.2 m/s.': '移动速度指移动的快慢，而非风速。大风半径是对风速不低于17.2 m/s区域的估计半径。',
  'Select a record to show its full track and stage changes on the map. History belongs to this world; export a replay to keep it before resetting.': '选择一条记录，即可在地图上显示其完整路径和阶段变化。记录仅属于当前世界；重置前可导出回放加以保存。',
  'Map grades: 0 Depression, 1 Tropical Storm, 2 Severe Tropical Storm, 3 Typhoon / Hurricane / Cyclone, 4 Very Strong, 5 Violent, then one more grade every 10 m/s above that.': '地图等级：0 热带低压，1 热带风暴，2 强热带风暴，3 台风/飓风/气旋，4 强，5 超强；此后风速每增加10 m/s，等级加一。',
  'Movement speed': '移动速度',
  'Merger': '合并',
  'Nearby storms in the same hemisphere affect each other’s movement: they can rotate around each other and draw closer. They merge within 100 km once both are at least 24 model hours old with winds of 17.2 m/s or more. The stronger storm keeps its ID and wind speed. Forming lows keep their own progress. Overlapping wind areas alone do not trigger a merger.': '同一半球相邻的风暴会相互影响移动，可能互相绕转并靠近。当两者生成都已满24个模型小时、风速不低于17.2 m/s，且中心相距不足100 km时，便会合并。较强的风暴保留其编号和风速，正在酝酿的低压保留各自的进度。仅仅风场重叠不会触发合并。',
  'Wind at centre': '中心风速',
  'Movement speed is the centre’s travel per model hour over the last step, excluding merger repositioning (0 at birth). Wind values are not movement speed. Centre wind can be weaker than the maximum wind around it.': '移动速度是中心在上一步中每模型小时的移动距离，不含合并造成的中心重新定位（刚生成时为0）。风速不是移动速度。中心风速可能小于其周围的最大风速。',
  'Canvas 2D map (WebGL unavailable). Fewer wind particles; the simulation is unaffected. Globe view needs WebGL; showing the flat map.': '正在使用Canvas 2D地图（WebGL不可用）。风粒子减少，但不影响模拟。地球仪视图需要WebGL，现显示平面地图。',
