  'Sarah': '萨拉', 'Tip': '泰培', 'Rusa': '鹿莎', 'Maemi': '鸣蝉', 'Nari': '百合', 'Kompasu': '圆规', 'Bolaven': '布拉万', 'Sanba': '三巴', 'Haiyan': '海燕', 'Chaba': '暹芭', 'Mangkhut': '山竹', 'Lingling': '玲玲', 'Mitag': '米娜', 'Hinnamnor': '轩岚诺',
  'Camille': '卡米尔', 'Tracy': '特蕾西', 'Andrew': '安德鲁', 'Mitch': '米奇', 'Odisha': '奥里萨', 'Catarina': '卡塔琳娜', 'Katrina': '卡特里娜', 'Wilma': '威尔玛', 'Gonu': '古奴', 'Sidr': '锡德', 'Nargis': '纳尔吉斯', 'Yasi': '亚西', 'Sandy': '桑迪', 'Pam': '帕姆', 'Patricia': '帕特里夏', 'Winston': '温斯顿', 'Harvey': '哈维', 'Irma': '艾尔玛', 'Maria': '玛丽亚', 'Dorian': '多里安', 'Fani': '法尼', 'Idai': '伊代', 'Amphan': '安攀', 'Ian': '伊恩', 'Freddy': '弗雷迪', 'Otis': '奥蒂斯',
  'Turn on Natural typhoon formation in the right panel and nature starts storms for you: a wave of formation conditions appears over warm tropical ocean somewhere in the world every two to three days. Use Cool water, Dry air, Cold air and Downdraft to weaken them before a depression forms, or let them grow. Turn it off to stop new waves.': '在右侧面板开启“台风自然生成”，大自然会替你制造风暴：全球某处温暖的热带海面上，每隔两到三天就会出现一波生成条件。你可以用冷海水、干燥空气、冷空气和下沉气流在热带低压形成前将其削弱，也可以任其发展。关闭后将不再出现新的生成条件。',
  'Damage report': '灾情报告', 'Storms dissipated': '已消亡风暴', 'Average lifetime': '平均存续时间',
  'City losses are cumulative estimates.': '城市损失为累计估计值。',
  'Low shear': '弱风切变', 'Strong shear': '强风切变',
  'Calms the upper winds so a storm can stay upright. Stacking is capped at −60 m/s.': '减弱高空风，使风暴保持垂直结构、顺利发展。叠加效果上限为 −60 m/s。',
  'Adds upper-level wind that tilts and tears a storm apart. Stacking is capped at +60 m/s.': '增强高空风，使风暴倾斜并被撕裂。叠加效果上限为 +60 m/s。',
  'World climate': '全球气候', 'Warming': '变暖', 'La Niña / El Niño': '拉尼娜 / 厄尔尼诺', 'Polar temperature': '极地气温',
  'Season': '季节', 'Spring': '春季', 'Summer': '夏季', 'Autumn': '秋季', 'Winter': '冬季',
  'Changing the season shifts the calendar; the world keeps running.': '更改季节会移动日历，世界继续运行。', 'The day of the year must be between 0 and 366.': '一年中的日期必须在 0 到 366 之间。',
  'Neutral': '中性', 'Climate:': '气候：', 'Unknown climate control.': '未知的气候调节项。', 'The climate could not be changed.': '无法更改气候。',
  'warming': '变暖', 'enso': '厄尔尼诺', 'polar': '极地气温',
  'Cool water': '冷海水', 'Dry air': '干燥空气', 'Cold air': '冷空气', 'Downdraft': '下沉气流',
  'Cool': '冷海水', 'Dry': '干燥空气', 'Cold': '冷空气', 'Sink': '下沉气流',
  'Cools the ocean by up to 3 °C per placement, capped at 30 °C, and forms a weak high. Cuts the storm’s ocean energy supply. Ocean only.': '每次放置最多使海表温度降低3 °C，叠加上限为30 °C，并形成弱高压，削减风暴的海洋能量供应。只能放置在海上。',
  'Reduces humidity and disrupts convection. Overlap with other weakening conditions to dissipate storms faster.': '降低湿度并扰乱对流。与其他削弱条件叠加，可让风暴更快消亡。',
  'Cools lower-level air by up to 3 °C, capped at 18 °C. Suppresses growth and weakens storms.': '使低层空气最多降温3 °C，叠加上限为18 °C，抑制风暴发展并使其减弱。',
  'Adds up to 1 m/s of descending air, capped at 9 m/s. Suppresses convection and weakens storms.': '最多增加1 m/s的下沉气流，叠加上限为9 m/s，抑制对流并使风暴减弱。',
  'Cool water must be placed over the ocean.': '冷海水必须放置在海上。',
  'Warm air': '暖空气', 'Updraft': '上升气流', 'Air': '气温', 'Rise': '上升',
  'Warms lower-level air by up to 3 °C and supports convection. Stacking is capped at +18 °C. Does not warm the ocean.': '使低层空气最多升温3 °C，有利于对流。叠加效果上限为 +18 °C，不会使海水升温。',
  'Adds up to 1 m/s of rising air to help a moist disturbance organise and grow. Stacking is capped at 9 m/s. Still needs warm ocean, moisture and a low.': '最多增加1 m/s的上升气流，帮助湿润扰动组织并发展。叠加上限为9 m/s。仍需要暖海水、水汽和低压。',
  'Warm': '水温', 'Moist': '湿度', 'Low': '低压', 'High': '高压',
