  'Play needs true or false.': '播放状态必须为 true 或 false。', 'Unknown worker request.': '未知的模拟请求。',
  'Malformed worker request.': '模拟请求格式不正确。', 'Simulation error.': '模拟出错。',
  'Calm tropics': '平静的热带海域',
  'No storms yet. Overlap warm water, moisture and a low over tropical ocean to organise one.': '暂无风暴。在热带海面上叠加暖海水、水汽和低压，即可孕育风暴。',
  'Disturbance organising': '扰动正在组织',
  'weakened into a remnant low': '减弱为残余低压', 'became a cold-core storm at high latitude': '在高纬度转为冷心风暴',
  'Unknown typhoon.': '未知的台风。',
