  // Map overlay row and tooltips
  'Moving streaks show surface wind speed and direction.': '流动的线条显示地面风速和风向。',
  'Colours the wind streaks by moisture. Brighter is wetter.': '按湿度给风的流线着色，越亮越湿润。',
  'Shades the areas where rain is falling.': '为正在下雨的区域着色。',
  'Draws isobars, lines of equal sea-level pressure.': '绘制等压线，即海平面气压相等各点的连线。',
  'Tints the ocean by sea-surface temperature.': '按海表温度为海面着淡色。',
  'Shows how many people live in each area.': '显示各地区的居住人口数。',
  'Recorded paths': '记录路径', 'Draws the full dashed track of every loaded past typhoon.': '以虚线绘出所有已载入历史台风的完整路径。',
  'City names': '城市名称', 'Shows the names of cities and places. Their dots always stay.': '显示城市和地名。圆点始终保留。',
  'Isobar values': '等压线数值', 'Shows the pressure number on each isobar.': '在每条等压线上标出气压数值。',
  'Sea names': '海洋名称', 'Shows sea, lake and river names.': '显示海、湖和河流的名称。',
  'Changes the world, not just the view. When on, nature starts new storms every two to three days. Saved in your replay.': '改变的是世界本身，而不只是视图。开启后，大自然每两到三天就会制造新的风暴。该设置会记录在你的回放中。',
  'Open the guide to the controls and conditions.': '打开操作和天气条件说明。',
  'Magnify the map. Shortcut: Shift +.': '放大地图。快捷键：Shift +',
  'Show more of the world. Shortcut: Shift -.': '显示更大范围。快捷键：Shift -',
  'Return the map to its starting position and zoom.': '将地图恢复到初始位置和缩放比例。',
  'Stop or resume time. Shortcut: Space.': '暂停或恢复时间。快捷键：空格键',
  'Select the previous speed. Shortcut: - or Shift+Tab.': '选择上一档速度。快捷键：- 或 Shift+Tab',
  'Select the next speed. Shortcut: + or Tab.': '选择下一档速度。快捷键：+ 或 Tab',
  'Normal speed': '正常速度', 'Run the world at its normal pace.': '以正常速度运行世界。',
  'Fast speed': '快速', 'Run the world four times faster.': '以4倍速度运行世界。',
  'Fastest speed': '最快速度', 'Run the world twelve times faster.': '以12倍速度运行世界。',
  'Switch between the 3D globe and the flat Equal Earth map.': '在3D地球仪和平面Equal Earth地图之间切换。',
  // footer-privacy
  'Privacy policy': '隐私政策', 'Buy me a coffee': '请我喝杯咖啡', 'Online leaderboard and privacy': '在线排行榜与隐私',
  'When a storm ends, your score (storm count, grade and estimated damage) is uploaded to the online leaderboard under an anonymous ID created on this device. The nickname shown there is chosen by you and is public, so do not use your real name. You can change it any time in the Ranking tab. Details are in the privacy policy linked below.': '风暴消亡后，你的成绩（风暴数量、等级和估计损失）会通过在此设备上生成的匿名 ID 上传到在线排行榜。排行榜上显示的昵称由你自己决定，且对所有人公开，请不要使用真实姓名。你可以随时在“排行榜”标签页中修改昵称。详情请见下方的隐私政策链接。',
  'You can delete your nickname and all your uploaded results yourself: open the Ranking tab and press Delete my records. It takes effect immediately. If you no longer have the device, email us at the address in the privacy policy.': '你可以自行删除昵称和所有已上传的成绩：打开“排行榜”标签页，点击“删除我的记录”，立即生效。如果你已不再拥有该设备，请按隐私政策中的地址给我们发邮件。',
  'Choose a nickname in the Ranking tab to appear on the online leaderboard. Nicknames are public.': '在“排行榜”标签页设置昵称，即可显示在在线排行榜上。昵称是公开的。',
  // leaderboard
  'World leaderboard': '全球排行榜',
  'This world': '当前世界',
  'Leaderboard period': '排行榜时段',
  'Live 24 h': '实时24小时',
